# Environment secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Python cache & environments
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
*.egg-info/

# Stable Diffusion / Hugging Face model downloads & weights
comic_generator/models/
**/models--*/
**/*.safetensors
**/*.bin
**/*.onnx
**/*.incomplete
**/*.lock
**/.locks/

# Generated comics and temporary files
comic_generator/generated/
comic_generator/test_sdxl.png
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.pdf

